KEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3IcHCH0oGw",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_LOUD"],"吵雜，但還是能交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3YcHCIABKAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3IcHCH8oHA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_ONE"],"1 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3YcHCIIBKAA"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3YcHCIMBKAE"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3IcHCIEBKB0",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["只能現場排隊等待，好吃的豬排店\n很少遇到豬排這麼恰到好處，價位中等，適合1-2人來\n\n。熟成酥炸腰內肉 $270（巨推👍\n比熟成黃金豬排多$40，但非常值得\n肉是一個半月型的量，不算多但味道好蓋過一切\n整個肉咬下去汁水飽滿，但同時紮實咬起來卡茲卡茲的\n都覺得自己多花40值得，飯的份量對男生來說剛好，旁邊的味島香鬆很搭配。\n\n。熟成黃金豬排$240\n份量乍一看比腰內多20%，味道也不錯，可以多加點起司醬，會有個熱鐵盤把起司熱到冒泡（隔壁桌點的）聞起來就香爆。\n\n豬排都自帶歐姆蛋（古溜的蛋$50）半熟半生水嫩嫩，拌飯超香愛吃蛋的可加點。\n\n。看其他網友介紹點了吉拿棒（Gina棒 $70）剛上桌就要吃，很像可麗露形狀的油條，糖粉不會太多，酥脆酥脆不死甜，個人覺得ok,但因為會比正餐先上，但不愛甜食者可跳過\n\n。昭和烤布丁$80，日系愛好者必點，是很紮實的類型，好吃，可做為完美收尾。\n\n米飯好吃、醬汁比較鹹不要一次加太多\n對得起這收費的飯食，推薦來吃吃看。",null,[0,41]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/2352181450637619959/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHYkU0eU5XbGFhelZLWTIxd1RtTnNhM2hSVkd4RVYyMDFRbUZHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2352181450637619959/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHYkU0eU5XbGFhelZLWTIxd1RtTnNhM2hSVkd4RVYyMDFRbUZHUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2352181450637619959/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHYkU0eU5XbGFhelZLWTIxd1RtTnNhM2hSVkd4RVYyMDFRbUZHUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2352181450637619959/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHYkU0eU5XbGFhelZLWTIxd1RtTnNhM2hSVkd4RVYyMDFRbUZHUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://busi