null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PARKING_OPTIONS"],"有哪些停車選項？",null,[[[["E:PARKING_OPTION_PAID_PARKING_LOT"],"付費停車位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3YcHCNoBKAA"],[["E:PARKING_OPTION_FREE_STREET_PARKING"],"免費路邊停車",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3YcHCNsBKAE"],[["E:PARKING_OPTION_PAID_PARKING_GARAGE"],"付費室內停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3YcHCNwBKAI"]]],null,"附近的停車場",null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3IcHCNkBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3YcHCN4BKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ3IcHCN0BKA0",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["不增加咖喱或是起司醬料的話，餐點價格都在300內，以店家張貼的說明使用的食材來看，是真的不貴。一般熟成豬排覺得稍微乾柴了一點，黑金豬排有增添竹碳粉在麵衣調味覺得蠻不錯，不只是外觀吸引眼球而已。加點的腰內肉口感跟風味就都還不錯。\n米飯原來蠻期待的，使用富里的米，但感覺煮出來的口感好像糊了一點，跟印象中富里米的口感不太一樣，難得使用東部富里米了，這蠻可惜的。\n食材上都用的蠻好的，但可能備料調理上客人多忙碌，價格又要在地人能接受，經營上也是蠻不容易，但三重能越來越多這樣的店家出現，提升在地的餐食水準進步是好事。",null,[0,255]]]],[null,1783261458000000,1783261458000000,"1 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfQmNWd2JJd2YtMmxJZzhZb3lBZlZHdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfQmNWd2JJd2YtMmxJZzhZb3lBZlZHdxoTQ2d3SWt0S3AwZ1lRdzQyRjBnTQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiI3MauydKWAxVyVPUHHd5HC5sQ_2MI3wEoDg"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2352181450637619959/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhUlZGNldrNWxiVGxRVVd4Q1prNXRTa3RTYmtKRVlUTktTMU5JWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/2352181450637619959/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhUlZGNldrNWxiVGxRVVd4Q1prNXRTa3RTYmtKRVlUTktTMU5JWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/2352181450637619959/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhUlZGNldrNWxiVGxRVVd4Q1prNXRTa3RTYmtKRVlUTktTMU5JWXhBQhAA",[null